      "value": "@{5ba54f21e3c8761e8c3080d8|full_name} I missed you're response, but my physics don't rest on colliders so I don't think its related to that, my thought is that its most likely due to physbone squish, it seems to jitter when squished, I was able to minimize some of my jittering by making my squish animation reach 100% a bit earlier in the animation",
